  <p class="cap" style="margin-top:28px">Rebuilt from the KML export of <em>Genealogy Resources — Croatia &amp; Surrounds</em>, kept whole at <code>data/genealogy-resources-croatia.kml</code>. Coordinates from the GeoNames dumps for HR, BA, SI, RS, HU, IT, AT and ME. Volume inventories from this archive's own walks of the FamilySearch waypoints. <strong>Nothing on this map is a finding</strong> — it is a record of what exists and how far we have got.</p>
